Pattern 4: 
import java.util.Scanner;

public class Solution {
    public static void main(String[] args){
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        int n = sc.nextInt();
        for(int i=n;i>=1;i--){
           for(int j=1;j<=i;j++){
             System.out.print("* ");
           } 
           System.out.println();
        }
    }
}
n = int(input()) 
for i in range(n,0,-1):  
 for j in range(1,i+1):    
   print("*",end=" ")   
 print()
here (n,0,-1) means what
n → start from n
0 → stop before reaching 0
-1 → decrease by 1 each time

